{
  "rc": {
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": "bg",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "0pt",
        "y": "0pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}",
        "h": "{parent.h}",
        "bgColor": "linear(#FFFFFF\\,#FDFBFD\\,#FAF2F9)@90|linear(#15171A\\,#1A191E\\,#221D26)@90"
      },
      {
        "id": "dot",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "14.0pt",
        "y": "{nm.y}+({nm.h}-5pt)/2",
        "w": "5pt",
        "h": "5pt",
        "bgColor": "#B4329B|#EE7FD6",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2.5pt",
          "leftB": "2.5pt",
          "rightT": "2.5pt",
          "rightB": "2.5pt"
        },
        "_note": "源色身份点(组件设计系统 §2):每个组件恰好一次,y 锚在组件名的实测框上。"
      },
      {
        "id": "nm",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "23.0pt",
        "y": "12pt",
        "w": "200pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "${@i18n.cTitle}",
        "fontSize": "13pt",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
      },
      {
        "id": "at",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "14.0pt",
        "y": "15pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-28.0pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "alignmentH": "2",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${endM},--)]",
        "fontSize": "9pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "_note": "数据时间锚 = 数据截至日(MM-DD),不是取数时刻 —— 三个源都滞后 1~4 天,写取数时刻是在骗人。"
      },
      {
        "id": "lab",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "14.0pt",
        "y": "33pt",
        "w": "132pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "${@i18n.cLab}",
        "fontSize": "10pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "_note": "左栏只有 132pt:英文「· vs prev week」放不下(iOS 实测截成 vs prev),英文只写前半句,涨跌的颜色已经说明方向。"
      },
      {
        "id": "lg0",
        "type": "line",
        "x": "14.0pt",
        "y": "51.5pt",
        "w": "12pt",
        "h": "4pt",
        "points": "[2,2,10,2]",
        "lineWidth": "3pt",
        "lineCap": "round",
        "strokeColor": "#B4329B|#EE7FD6",
        "_note": "图例 = 一小段与折线同色的线(不用圆点:圆点是组件的源色身份点,每个组件只出现一次)。"
      },
      {
        "id": "cn0",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "30.0pt",
        "y": "48pt",
        "w": "72pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${n0},--)]",
        "fontSize": "12pt",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
      },
      {
        "id": "cc0",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "102.0pt",
        "y": "49pt",
        "w": "44pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "alignmentH": "2",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "$[if::(eq::(${k0flat},1),${@i18n.flatS},if::(eq::(if::(eq::(${k0flat},1),0,if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${k0up},__none__),__none__),0,if::(eq::(${k0up},1),1,if::(eq::(${k0up},0),1,0)))),1),${k0chgT},--))]",
        "fontSize": "10.5pt",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "textColor": "$[if::(eq::(${k0flat},1),#9AA0A6|#8E939B,if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${k0up},__none__),__none__),#9AA0A6|#8E939B,if::(eq::(${k0up},1),if::(eq::(${k0up},1),#B4329B|#EE7FD6,#B45309|#F5A524),if::(eq::(${k0up},0),if::(eq::(${k0up},1),#B4329B|#EE7FD6,#B45309|#F5A524),#9AA0A6|#8E939B))))]"
      },
      {
        "id": "cw0",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "14.0pt",
        "y": "63pt",
        "w": "132pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "$[if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),findNotEmpty::(${w0Z},--),findNotEmpty::(${w0E},--))]",
        "fontSize": "20pt",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
        "hide": "$[if::(eq::(if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),findNotEmpty::(${w0Z},--),findNotEmpty::(${w0E},--)),--),1,0)]"
      },
      {
        "id": "cw0E",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "14.0pt",
        "y": "69.5pt",
        "w": "132pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "--",
        "fontSize": "20pt",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
        "hide": "$[if::(eq::(if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),findNotEmpty::(${w0Z},--),findNotEmpty::(${w0E},--)),--),0,2)]"
      },
      {
        "id": "lg1",
        "type": "line",
        "x": "14.0pt",
        "y": "91.5pt",
        "w": "12pt",
        "h": "4pt",
        "points": "[2,2,10,2]",
        "lineWidth": "3pt",
        "lineCap": "round",
        "strokeColor": "#2F6FDB|#6CA4F8"
      },
      {
        "id": "cn1",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "30.0pt",
        "y": "88pt",
        "w": "72pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${n1},--)]",
        "fontSize": "12pt",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
      },
      {
        "id": "cc1",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "102.0pt",
        "y": "89pt",
        "w": "44pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "alignmentH": "2",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "$[if::(eq::(${k1flat},1),${@i18n.flatS},if::(eq::(if::(eq::(${k1flat},1),0,if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${k1up},__none__),__none__),0,if::(eq::(${k1up},1),1,if::(eq::(${k1up},0),1,0)))),1),${k1chgT},--))]",
        "fontSize": "10.5pt",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "textColor": "$[if::(eq::(${k1flat},1),#9AA0A6|#8E939B,if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${k1up},__none__),__none__),#9AA0A6|#8E939B,if::(eq::(${k1up},1),if::(eq::(${k1up},1),#B4329B|#EE7FD6,#B45309|#F5A524),if::(eq::(${k1up},0),if::(eq::(${k1up},1),#B4329B|#EE7FD6,#B45309|#F5A524),#9AA0A6|#8E939B))))]"
      },
      {
        "id": "cw1",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "14.0pt",
        "y": "103pt",
        "w": "132pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "$[if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),findNotEmpty::(${w1Z},--),findNotEmpty::(${w1E},--))]",
        "fontSize": "20pt",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
        "hide": "$[if::(eq::(if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),findNotEmpty::(${w1Z},--),findNotEmpty::(${w1E},--)),--),1,0)]"
      },
      {
        "id": "cw1E",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "14.0pt",
        "y": "109.5pt",
        "w": "132pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "--",
        "fontSize": "20pt",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
        "hide": "$[if::(eq::(if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),findNotEmpty::(${w1Z},--),findNotEmpty::(${w1E},--)),--),0,2)]"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(${rtOk},1),if::(eq::(${rtSame},1),0,if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),1,0)),0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "rtz",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "14.0pt",
            "y": "130pt",
            "w": "132pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "text": "${rtBig}${@i18n.rA}${rtSmall}${@i18n.rB}${rtT}${@i18n.rC}",
            "fontSize": "10pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B"
          }
        ],
        "_note": "倍数一句话:中文「react 约为 vue 的 11 倍」、英文「react is 11× vue」—— 两种语序,按 App 语言分两支。"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(${rtOk},1),if::(eq::(${rtSame},1),0,if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),0,1)),0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "rte",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "14.0pt",
            "y": "130pt",
            "w": "132pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "text": "${rtBig}${@i18n.rA}${rtT}${@i18n.rC}${rtSmall}",
            "fontSize": "10pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(${rtSame},1),1,0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "rts",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "14.0pt",
            "y": "130pt",
            "w": "132pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "text": "${@i18n.cSame}",
            "fontSize": "10pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "cAxis",
        "type": "line",
        "points": "[0,89.0,164.0,89.0]",
        "lineWidth": "1pt",
        "strokeColor": "#1A0E1116|#1AF3F4F6",
        "x": "160pt",
        "y": "34pt",
        "w": "164.0pt",
        "h": "90.0pt"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(${ok1},1),1,0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "cl1",
            "type": "line",
            "points": "[$[findNotEmpty::(${pc1},0\\,999\\,1\\,999)]]",
            "lineWidth": "1.8pt",
            "lineCap": "round",
            "lineJoin": "round",
            "strokeColor": "#2F6FDB|#6CA4F8",
            "x": "160pt",
            "y": "34pt",
            "w": "164.0pt",
            "h": "90.0pt"
          },
          {
            "id": "cr1",
            "type": "line",
            "points": "[157.99,$[findNotEmpty::(${yc1},-99)],158.0,$[findNotEmpty::(${yc1},-99)]]",
            "lineWidth": "7.9pt",
            "lineCap": "round",
            "strokeColor": "#FFFFFF|#15171A",
            "x": "160pt",
            "y": "34pt",
            "w": "164.0pt",
            "h": "90.0pt"
          },
          {
            "id": "cd1",
            "type": "line",
            "points": "[157.99,$[findNotEmpty::(${yc1},-99)],158.0,$[findNotEmpty::(${yc1},-99)]]",
            "lineWidth": "5.3pt",
            "lineCap": "round",
            "strokeColor": "#2F6FDB|#6CA4F8",
            "x": "160pt",
            "y": "34pt",
            "w": "164.0pt",
            "h": "90.0pt"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(${ok0},1),1,0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "cl0",
            "type": "line",
            "points": "[$[findNotEmpty::(${pc0},0\\,999\\,1\\,999)]]",
            "lineWidth": "1.8pt",
            "lineCap": "round",
            "lineJoin": "round",
            "strokeColor": "#B4329B|#EE7FD6",
            "x": "160pt",
            "y": "34pt",
            "w": "164.0pt",
            "h": "90.0pt"
          },
          {
            "id": "cr0",
            "type": "line",
            "points": "[157.99,$[findNotEmpty::(${yc0},-99)],158.0,$[findNotEmpty::(${yc0},-99)]]",
            "lineWidth": "7.9pt",
            "lineCap": "round",
            "strokeColor": "#FFFFFF|#15171A",
            "x": "160pt",
            "y": "34pt",
            "w": "164.0pt",
            "h": "90.0pt"
          },
          {
            "id": "cd0",
            "type": "line",
            "points": "[157.99,$[findNotEmpty::(${yc0},-99)],158.0,$[findNotEmpty::(${yc0},-99)]]",
            "lineWidth": "5.3pt",
            "lineCap": "round",
            "strokeColor": "#B4329B|#EE7FD6",
            "x": "160pt",
            "y": "34pt",
            "w": "164.0pt",
            "h": "90.0pt"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "cwin",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "160pt",
        "y": "130pt",
        "w": "164.0pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "alignmentH": "2",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "${@i18n.cWin}",
        "fontSize": "9pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B"
      }
    ],
    "i18n": {
      "zh-CN": {
        "flatS": "持平",
        "cLab": "近 7 天下载 · 较上周",
        "cTitle": "下载对比",
        "cWin": "各自走势 · 近 30 天",
        "cSame": "两者相差不到 10%",
        "rA": " 约为 ",
        "rB": " 的 ",
        "rC": " 倍"
      },
      "en-US": {
        "flatS": "Flat",
        "cLab": "7-day downloads",
        "cTitle": "Compare",
        "cWin": "Each on own scale · 30d",
        "cSame": "Within 10% of each other",
        "rA": " is ",
